10
00:02:39,840 --> 00:02:41,120
Okay, okay, I get it.

11
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:42,240
Bye.

12
00:02:46,400 --> 00:02:46,919
Come here.

13
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:47,960
No snatching.

14
00:02:48,520 --> 00:02:49,599
Work with me, everyone.

15
00:02:49,800 --> 00:02:50,919
You'll all get paid.

16
00:02:50,919 --> 00:02:51,960
And you'll all get milk.

17
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,560
One carton each, no snatching.

18
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:54,520
Stop pushing!

19
00:02:54,759 --> 00:02:55,439
Alright.

20
00:02:55,520 --> 00:02:56,560
Everyone, listen to me.

21
00:02:56,639 --> 00:02:57,719
Those who got the milk,

22
00:02:57,719 --> 00:02:58,759
come here and sign.

23
00:02:58,759 --> 00:03:00,560
You can only get the money after signing, okay?

24
00:03:00,800 --> 00:03:01,960
Okay!

25
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:03,840
Ten yuan per person.

26
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,000
Ten yuan.

27
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:06,960
Friday at 8:00 a.m.,

28
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:09,680
Nankang High School anniversary reception.

29
00:03:09,919 --> 00:03:12,479
This ten yuan is just a deposit.

30
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:14,199
A deposit.

31
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:17,080
The final payment will be issued after the event.

32
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:18,599
Don't be late!

33
00:03:18,599 --> 00:03:19,759
How much is it in total?

34
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:20,400
Yeah, how much?

35
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:21,960
Thirty per person.

36
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:22,960
Thirty.

37
00:03:23,039 --> 00:03:24,800
Plus a pair of sneakers.

38
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:27,719
Tell me how much.

39
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:29,080
I'll pay you the deposit.

40
00:03:29,719 --> 00:03:30,599
Twenty.

41
00:03:31,520 --> 00:03:32,439
Per person.

42
00:03:39,199 --> 00:03:40,719
I'll give each of you forty.

43
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,840
But you need to find me some pretty ones.

44
00:03:43,240 --> 00:03:43,479
Okay.

45
00:03:43,479 --> 00:03:44,599
As pretty as you.

46
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,479
Wang Xiaozhang, this way, please.

47
00:04:05,360 --> 00:04:07,360
You can never be too careful.

48
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:09,800
