57
00:04:22,839 --> 00:04:23,920
If you don't want to do it, just leave.

58
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,639
Uncle, this is Principal Zhang from the school.

59
00:04:27,839 --> 00:04:28,319
Professor Cao.

60
00:04:28,319 --> 00:04:29,000
Hello, hello.

61
00:04:29,399 --> 00:04:30,720
Having you here this time

62
00:04:31,120 --> 00:04:32,839
