63
00:04:32,839 --> 00:04:33,439
It's my duty.

64
00:04:33,439 --> 00:04:34,800
The honor is all mine.

65
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,160
What exactly do you want?

66
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,199
I'm calling the police.

67
00:04:37,199 --> 00:04:39,240
Please visit often and give us your guidance.

68
00:04:39,319 --> 00:04:39,759
Alright, will do.

69
00:04:39,759 --> 00:04:40,720
Coming through, excuse me.

70
00:04:46,959 --> 00:04:47,680
What are you doing?

71
00:04:48,399 --> 00:04:49,040
Thank you, teacher.

72
00:04:49,680 --> 00:04:50,680
Professor Cao, this way, please.

73
00:04:50,680 --> 00:04:51,160
Alright, alright.

74
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:54,959
Having you here is a tremendous honor.

75
00:04:54,959 --> 00:04:55,959
Don't mention it.

76
00:04:58,279 --> 00:04:59,920
This is a little token of our appreciation.

77
00:05:00,160 --> 00:05:01,360
Thank you, thank you.

78
00:05:01,839 --> 00:05:02,959
Alright, goodbye. Goodbye.

79
00:05:02,959 --> 00:05:03,600
Thank you, thank you.

80
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,680
Teacher Tang.

81
00:05:05,079 --> 00:05:06,319
Long time no see.

82
00:05:06,920 --> 00:05:07,319
Professor Cao.

83
00:05:07,319 --> 00:05:08,480
Long time no see.

84
00:05:10,399 --> 00:05:11,040
Professor Cao.

85
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,519
Hello.

86
00:05:11,959 --> 00:05:12,439
Professor Cao.

87
00:05:12,680 --> 00:05:13,360
Hello, hello.

88
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:13,759
A small gift.

89
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:14,879
It's pretty nice.

90
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,040
Really nice.

91
00:05:16,439 --> 00:05:17,439
Let me see mine.

92
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:18,319
Take a look.

93
00:05:31,079 --> 00:05:31,519
Liaoping

94
00:05:31,759 --> 00:05:33,000
Long time no see. Long time no see.

95
00:05:33,240 --> 00:05:33,959
Have a seat. Have a seat.

96
00:05:36,279 --> 00:05:37,120
Where are you coming from?

97
00:05:37,560 --> 00:05:38,160
Where from?

98
00:05:38,319 --> 00:05:39,000
I came from Beijing.

99
00:05:39,160 --> 00:05:39,839
Just got here from Beijing.

100
00:05:40,279 --> 00:05:41,600
Hello. Are you Professor Cao?

101
00:05:41,959 --> 00:05:42,360
Yes.

102
00:05:42,439 --> 00:05:44,319
A gentleman asked me to give this to you.

103
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,600
Thank you.

104
00:05:46,839 --> 00:05:48,600
Deputy Mayor Xie is in the conference room next door.

105
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:50,160
He will meet with you privately.

106
00:05:57,920 --> 00:05:58,920
I'll head over there first.

107
00:08:10,720 --> 00:08:13,720
The Book of Songs says a day apart is like three autumns.

108
00:08:14,199 --> 00:08:16,439
Wasn't it a solemn promise?

109
00:08:16,600 --> 00:08:19,040
Why haven't I heard from you since you returned?

110
00:08:21,800 --> 00:08:23,639
Important people have short memories.

111
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:26,720
I'm just calling to remind you.

112
00:08:27,079 --> 00:08:28,680
I hope I didn't offend you.

113
00:08:29,959 --> 00:08:30,759
I'm not doing it.

114
00:08:31,399 --> 00:08:32,240
I can't do it anyway.

115
00:08:32,639 --> 00:08:34,200
Just for today,

116
00:08:34,440 --> 00:08:36,080
or forever?

117
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:38,399
It makes no difference to me.

118
00:08:38,639 --> 00:08:40,240
Have you thought this through?

119
00:08:40,440 --> 00:08:41,879
Are you threatening me?

120
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:44,879
You can call my workplace anytime.

121
00:08:45,639 --> 00:08:47,399
Cao Liaoping will never do it.

122
00:09:03,679 --> 00:09:04,440
Uncle, what are you doing here?

123
00:09:04,679 --> 00:09:05,840
The event is about to start.

124
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:07,200
My headache is acting up. I don't feel well.

125
00:09:07,320 --> 00:09:08,120
I'm heading out.

126
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:08,960
The event is starting soon.

127
00:09:08,960 --> 00:09:09,879
You're not attending?

128
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,159
You were fine, why the sudden headache?

129
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:14,320
Why don't I take you to the hospital?

130
00:09:48,639 --> 00:09:49,320
Boss Lin

131
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:50,440
Jin Lina

132
00:09:50,799 --> 00:09:51,720
Boss Lin

133
00:09:52,279 --> 00:09:52,639
Boss Lin

134
00:09:52,639 --> 00:09:53,159
I have something urgent.

135
00:09:53,159 --> 00:09:53,759
We'll talk when I get back.

136
00:09:53,759 --> 00:09:54,919
Boss Lin, you can't leave.

137
00:09:55,000 --> 00:09:55,919
I said I have something urgent.

138
00:09:56,000 --> 00:09:56,600
I won't short you the money.

139
00:09:56,600 --> 00:09:58,519
Boss Lin, a big boss can't just skip the bill.

140
00:09:58,720 --> 00:10:00,279
It's not easy for us students, you know.

141
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:11,879
Tell you what, I'm going to get the money now.

142
00:10:12,279 --> 00:10:13,120
I'll leave my bag as collateral.

143
00:10:14,200 --> 00:10:15,039
Why are you looking at me like that?

144
00:10:15,039 --> 00:10:16,399
This bag is worth more than your final payment.

145
00:10:16,399 --> 00:10:17,519
I don't want your bag.

146
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:20,039
You can't leave. You can't leave.

147
00:10:20,039 --> 00:10:21,080
You can't leave.

148
00:10:21,399 --> 00:10:22,080
You can't leave.

149
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,519
Leave your watch here as collateral.

150
00:10:31,360 --> 00:10:33,440
It's expensive. You can't afford it if you lose it.

151
00:10:45,279 --> 00:10:46,559
After speaking with the target,

152
00:10:46,559 --> 00:10:48,799
I'll notify you by radio at 5:30 PM.

153
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,080
You can call our office anytime.

154
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,600
Cao Liaoping will never do it.

155
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:17,159
If I wanted to call,

156
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:20,159
I would've called your office long ago.

157
00:11:20,440 --> 00:11:22,759
I wouldn't have gone to such lengths to wait until now.

158
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,240
To be honest,

159
00:11:24,480 --> 00:11:25,240
Brother Cao,

160
00:11:25,639 --> 00:11:27,480
there are only two ways to make friends.

161
00:11:27,759 --> 00:11:28,679
One is through coercion,

162
00:11:28,759 --> 00:11:29,799
the other is through bribery.

163
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:32,279
Old Zhu never plays dirty.

164
00:11:32,600 --> 00:11:34,159
The German plan wasn't my idea.

165
00:11:34,159 --> 00:11:35,240
If it were me,

166
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:37,159
I would definitely show true sincerity.

167
00:11:43,360 --> 00:11:45,159
Someone delivered fish to my home.

168
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:46,919
Did you know about that?

169
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:47,840
Yes.

170
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:50,000
Fish caught in the Taiwan Strait.

171
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,159
It belongs to us both.

172
00:11:51,279 --> 00:11:51,960
A truck

173
00:11:51,960 --> 00:11:54,159
crashed into the phone booth outside our home.

174
00:11:54,879 --> 00:11:56,200
Did you arrange that too?

175
00:11:58,360 --> 00:11:59,320
As for that,

176
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,440
it absolutely wasn't our doing.

177
00:12:01,759 --> 00:12:04,240
We don't have that much power on the mainland.

178
00:12:06,200 --> 00:12:07,519
This is a matter of great importance.

179
00:12:07,639 --> 00:12:10,600
If it were me, I wouldn't feel at ease either.

180
00:12:10,639 --> 00:12:11,600
From now on,

181
00:12:11,600 --> 00:12:12,399
safety comes first.

182
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:13,720
For your safety,

183
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:16,120
let's stick to places you trust.

184
00:12:16,600 --> 00:12:19,399
Hong Kong, China, Macau, China, South Korea, or Japan.

185
00:12:19,639 --> 00:12:21,879
I'll go wherever you say.

186
00:12:22,039 --> 00:12:23,120
At any time,

187
00:12:23,120 --> 00:12:24,440
within two minutes,

188
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,799
if the other party doesn't show up,

189
00:12:26,159 --> 00:12:27,919
the meeting is immediately canceled.

190
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:29,120
Regardless of the reason,

191
00:12:29,320 --> 00:12:30,960
it will be postponed for two weeks.

192
00:12:31,120 --> 00:12:32,759
If they still don't show up,

193
00:12:32,759 --> 00:12:34,120
we will change our contact method.

194
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:36,000
The pre-arranged protocols,

195
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,759
we both must strictly follow.

196
00:12:38,120 --> 00:12:38,960
To ensure nothing goes wrong.

197
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,080
If we meet up to talk,

198
00:12:44,600 --> 00:12:45,600
and I ask you to come to the mainland,

199
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:46,960
would you dare?

200
00:12:47,399 --> 00:12:48,320
You pick the place,

201
00:12:48,320 --> 00:12:49,080
and I'll come to you.

202
00:12:50,240 --> 00:12:51,080
Next month,

203
00:12:52,039 --> 00:12:53,320
I'm going to Beijing for a meeting.

204
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,279
To Beijing?

205
00:12:55,600 --> 00:12:56,440
Are you also going to

206
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:57,919
meet under the Tiananmen Gate Tower?

207
00:12:58,679 --> 00:13:01,120
You haven't even seen how many traffic lights are on Chang'an Avenue.

208
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:02,240
Just to meet someone you don't even know

209
00:13:02,240 --> 00:13:03,320
is reliable or not,

210
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:04,480
to take such a huge risk...

211
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:06,039
Are you throwing your life away?

212
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:08,120
Guangzhou, Shenzhen, Hong Kong, China, or Macau, China.

213
00:13:08,120 --> 00:13:09,360
Anywhere could work for a meeting!

214
00:13:09,559 --> 00:13:11,679
Why must you run right into the Communists' heartland?

215
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,600
Don't you think it might be a trap?

216
00:13:13,960 --> 00:13:15,919
Just to meet an untrustworthy mainlander,

217
00:13:16,159 --> 00:13:17,440
you show your face in public.

218
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:19,039
Who do you think you are?

219
00:13:27,559 --> 00:13:28,759
Lee Teng-hui's "diplomatic" route

220
00:13:28,759 --> 00:13:30,000
reached a climactic milestone

221
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:31,279
when he finally secured

222
00:13:31,440 --> 00:13:32,919
an opportunity for a private "visit to the US,"

223
00:13:32,919 --> 00:13:35,399
visiting his alma mater, Cornell University,

224
00:13:35,559 --> 00:13:37,080
and delivering a speech

225
00:13:37,080 --> 00:13:39,600
titled "The Will of the People Lives in My Heart".

226
00:13:40,000 --> 00:13:40,559
Regardless,

227
00:13:40,759 --> 00:13:42,320
from the authorities' "diplomatic" standpoint,

228
00:13:42,679 --> 00:13:44,200
it was indeed a breakthrough.

229
00:13:44,279 --> 00:13:46,919
What the hell is that lunatic trying to do?

230
00:13:47,759 --> 00:13:49,120
One day he says he's going left,

231
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:51,399
the next you see him standing on the right.

232
00:13:51,679 --> 00:13:52,960
Just like Cao Liaoping,

233
00:13:52,960 --> 00:13:53,960
constantly going back on his word.

234
00:13:53,960 --> 00:13:55,240
I have no idea what they're thinking.

235
00:13:55,360 --> 00:13:57,320
The MIB people are too naive.

236
00:13:57,600 --> 00:13:58,879
If something actually goes wrong,

237
00:13:59,240 --> 00:14:00,360
they won't even be able to save themselves.

238
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:02,279
How could they possibly protect you?

239
00:14:04,039 --> 00:14:05,399
His accent is awful.

240
00:14:05,519 --> 00:14:07,000
Did nobody teach him better?

241
00:14:10,440 --> 00:14:11,720
What are you talking about?

242
00:14:12,039 --> 00:14:13,559
His Japanese accent.

243
00:14:13,679 --> 00:14:15,440
It's really inaccurate, isn't it?

244
00:14:19,279 --> 00:14:20,480
I'm asking you a question.

245
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:22,679
Can you just not go to Beijing?

246
00:14:25,440 --> 00:14:27,679
Next month, I'm going to Beijing for a meeting.

247
00:14:29,559 --> 00:14:30,240
Fine.

248
00:14:31,080 --> 00:14:31,919
See you then.

249
00:14:35,399 --> 00:14:37,039
There's no turning back now, huh?

250
00:14:37,240 --> 00:14:39,440
He wants you to go to Beijing.

251
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:41,120
Are you going to go?

252
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,000
I heard

253
00:14:56,960 --> 00:14:58,240
Beijing is so dry

254
00:14:58,759 --> 00:15:00,200
your lips get chapped.

255
00:15:01,600 --> 00:15:02,720
Is that true?

256
00:15:16,639 --> 00:15:17,159
Remember.

257
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,320
Don't ever

258
00:15:19,039 --> 00:15:21,519
do anything regardless of the cost.

259
00:15:22,080 --> 00:15:23,080
Leave in one piece,

260
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:24,399
and come back in one piece.

261
00:15:58,440 --> 00:16:02,879
Comrade 92973, please record.

262
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:08,360
Comrade 92973, please record.

263
00:16:09,799 --> 00:16:11,840
零八四八

264
00:16:12,960 --> 00:16:15,039
2223

265
00:16:16,519 --> 00:16:18,600
9105

266
00:16:20,039 --> 00:16:22,120
1467

267
00:16:23,519 --> 00:16:25,720
6224

268
00:16:51,200 --> 00:16:53,879
All is well. See you in Beijing.

269
00:17:13,319 --> 00:17:14,200
You know what,

270
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,519
that Qian Wenying was right.

271
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:18,880
This guy from Taiwan, China is totally unreliable.

272
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:20,480
He's just faking generosity.

273
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:22,599
Hello, your fish balls are ready.

274
00:17:22,599 --> 00:17:23,480
Enjoy your meal.

275
00:17:23,799 --> 00:17:25,880
If we didn't have sharp eyes,

276
00:17:25,880 --> 00:17:27,400
he would've gotten away.

277
00:17:27,400 --> 00:17:29,200
One or two would be fine,

278
00:17:29,200 --> 00:17:30,480
but you brought so many classmates here.

279
00:17:30,480 --> 00:17:31,640
They'll all be asking you for it later.

280
00:17:31,640 --> 00:17:33,119
You shouldn't do that.

281
00:17:33,119 --> 00:17:34,720
But I kept his watch.

282
00:17:35,039 --> 00:17:36,680
If worst comes to worst, I'll sell it.

283
00:17:36,839 --> 00:17:38,319
