701
00:32:16,799 --> 00:32:18,000
Besides pigs, cattle, horses, and sheep,

702
00:32:18,000 --> 00:32:19,279
I can apply this to other things.

703
00:32:19,279 --> 00:32:21,119
Remembering what people say is the same.

704
00:32:21,119 --> 00:32:22,920
From numbers and dates to daily habits.

705
00:32:22,920 --> 00:32:24,000
This is the pattern memory technique.

706
00:32:24,000 --> 00:32:25,160
So many people saying so many things,

707
00:32:25,160 --> 00:32:26,079
