708
00:32:26,079 --> 00:32:26,839
You have to find a method.

709
00:32:26,839 --> 00:32:27,640
That's what you said.

710
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:30,759
I said rote memorization is the best way.

711
00:32:31,000 --> 00:32:32,079
