we'll open the champagne.

845
00:37:48,000 --> 00:37:48,920
I will devote my all.

846
00:37:49,920 --> 00:37:50,920
Brother,

847
00:37:52,760 --> 00:37:54,000
you must be careful.

848
00:37:54,639 --> 00:37:57,280
I don't want to send a funeral wreath to your family.

849
00:37:58,119 --> 00:38:00,039
On the day you return safely,

850
00:38:00,760 --> 00:38:02,119
you'll be a Director.

851
00:38:08,679 --> 00:38:10,119
As for the details,

852
00:38:10,559 --> 00:38:11,880
they must be carefully thought out.

853
00:38:11,880 --> 00:38:13,079
The stakes are high.

854
00:38:13,360 --> 00:38:15,039
We've made the plans

855
00:38:15,039 --> 00:38:15,800
and run through them repeatedly.

856
00:38:15,800 --> 00:38:16,679
There shouldn't be any problems.

857
00:38:18,679 --> 00:38:20,880
Your messenger has already been caught.

858
00:38:21,599 --> 00:38:23,159
Who will act as your Liaison?

859
00:38:23,159 --> 00:38:24,039
Lin Kanshan.

860
00:38:24,079 --> 00:38:24,880
Which Shan?

861
00:38:25,719 --> 00:38:26,400
It's...

862
00:38:26,719 --> 00:38:28,119
You decide the details yourself.

863
00:38:28,760 --> 00:38:30,760
As for the item we want,

864
00:38:31,320 --> 00:38:33,280
if your friend is willing to hand it over,

865
00:38:33,679 --> 00:38:35,079
then it's the Oath of the Peach Garden.

866
00:38:35,480 --> 00:38:36,880
If they refuse,

867
00:38:37,280 --> 00:38:38,480
then it ends here.

868
00:38:40,360 --> 00:38:41,760
And the Communists won't get it either.

869
00:38:52,920 --> 00:38:55,159
Don't be late heading back.

870
00:38:55,679 --> 00:38:56,679
I had time off the past two days.

871
00:38:56,840 --> 00:38:57,840
I didn't need to go back early anyway.

872
00:39:01,360 --> 00:39:02,320
Look at me.

873
00:39:03,599 --> 00:39:04,800
Look at me.

874
00:39:09,239 --> 00:39:10,039
Promise me.

875
00:39:10,239 --> 00:39:12,159
Never go taking photos again.

876
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:16,480
Even with your and your aunt's guts combined,

877
00:39:16,480 --> 00:39:17,679
I wouldn't dare take any more photos.

878
00:39:18,360 --> 00:39:19,199
What's wrong?

879
00:39:20,280 --> 00:39:21,119
Let me see.

880
00:39:21,559 --> 00:39:22,840
Why are there blisters?

881
00:39:23,320 --> 00:39:24,559
Were you drinking with them?

882
00:39:24,800 --> 00:39:25,559
When they drink,

883
00:39:25,559 --> 00:39:27,239
you should just water yours down.

884
00:39:27,239 --> 00:39:28,440
Are you stupid?

885
00:39:29,800 --> 00:39:30,679
I know, I know.

886
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:36,639
What time are you meeting that person tomorrow?

887
00:39:37,079 --> 00:39:38,119
I don't know either.

888
00:39:38,119 --> 00:39:40,400
Qian Wenying told me to wait to hear from her.

889
00:39:41,880 --> 00:39:42,559
I'm leaving then.

890
00:39:42,639 --> 00:39:43,320
I'm off.

891
00:39:44,599 --> 00:39:45,599
Take care.

892
00:40:47,119 --> 00:40:48,440
Don't you think there's something wrong with Chunxiao?

893
00:40:48,440 --> 00:40:49,920
He's definitely their mole.

894
00:41:27,280 --> 00:41:29,079
What Director Wei just mentioned,

895
00:41:29,079 --> 00:41:30,559
you need to review it carefully.

896
00:41:30,559 --> 00:41:30,960
Understood.

897
00:41:31,800 --> 00:41:32,440
Chunxiao.

898
00:41:32,440 --> 00:41:33,239
Still working this late?

899
00:42:02,840 --> 00:42:03,559
Jinlan

900
00:42:04,639 --> 00:42:05,360
Jinlan

901
00:42:05,599 --> 00:42:06,320
Jinlan

902
00:43:08,440 --> 00:43:09,159
I'm Wang Kai,

903
00:43:09,519 --> 00:43:10,880
inviting you to watch the TV drama

904
00:43:11,159 --> 00:43:11,880
Confrontation

905
00:43:12,199 --> 00:43:12,800
Let's go.

906
00:43:12,880 --> 00:43:13,679
Wait a minute.

907
00:43:14,039 --> 00:43:15,039
This isn't my watch.

908
00:43:15,039 --> 00:43:16,159
This is your watch.

909
00:43:16,760 --> 00:43:17,920
It's a fake.

910
00:43:19,840 --> 00:43:21,159
The day the postman was arrested,

911
00:43:21,159 --> 00:43:22,639
he was at the scene.

912
00:43:22,639 --> 00:43:24,079
He's leaving Minzhong soon.

913
00:43:24,360 --> 00:43:25,920
If he's heading to Beijing,

914
00:43:25,920 --> 00:43:27,079
that would be interesting.

915
00:43:27,199 --> 00:43:29,199
Once we get to Beijing, let's not meet again.

916
00:43:29,360 --> 00:43:30,519
Here are your flight ticket and documents.

917
00:43:30,519 --> 00:43:31,239
Have a pleasant trip.

918
00:43:31,239 --> 00:43:32,039
Thanks.

919
00:43:33,400 --> 00:43:34,320
Hello. Where to?

920
00:43:34,599 --> 00:43:35,320
Two to Beijing.

921
00:43:35,559 --> 00:43:36,079
Okay.
